  "text": "You're someone with a connection to the powers of the First World, granting you otherworldly features and abilities. You gain the fadrim trait. You gain a weakness to cold iron equal to half your level (minimum 1). You can cast Light as a primal innate spell at will, though this spell might change if you select a lineage feat. A cantrip is heightened to half your level rounded up. You also gain low-light vision, or you gain darkvision if your ancestry already has low-light vision. You can select from fadrim feats and feats from your ancestry whenever you gain an ancestry feat.",
